ed": 4.23, "realized": 6.5, "forecasted": true}], "definitions": "A closed trade = everything one player did in one market this season, once nothing is left open there.\n- Expected edge, Polymarket: (your forecast - price paid - taker fee) per share. No forecast sent = forecast is the\n  price, so expected edge is just minus the fee.\n- Expected edge, memecoins: what the fill gave up against Jupiter's reference price at entry (impact + fees), per $.\n- Realized edge: closed P&L per share (Polymarket) or per $ put in (memecoins).\n- R-multiple: closed P&L / money put in. 1R = the whole stake, because a Polymarket share or a memecoin can go to 0\n  and the Arena has no stop orders. -1.0R = lost everything; +0.05R = made 5% of the stake.\nBands: Polymarket by average entry price; memecoins by the pool they entered (launch curve, small pool, large pool)."}, "trades": [{"id": 24272, "ts": 1795789917.640395, "season_id": 0, "arena": "polymarket", "side": "sell", "symbol": "No \u00b7 Will the price of Bitcoin be above $60,000 on November 27?", "market_id": "34114155695617452689607165240427359063522914971141596717163897325773455794859", "status": "filled", "shares": 563.19, "avg_price": 0.09010085406345991, "notional": 50.7439, "realized_pnl": 4.812479999999994, "forecast": null, "reason": "", "team": "undertow"}, {"id": 24265, "ts": 1795772894.49873, "season_id": 0, "arena": "polymarket", "side": "buy", "symbol": "No \u00b7 Will the price of Bitcoin be above $60,000 on November 27?", "market_id": "34114155695617452689607165240427359063522914971141596717163897325773455794859", "status": "filled", "shares": 563.19, "avg_price": 0.08, "notional": 45.055200000000006, "realized_pnl": null, "forecast": 0.1227, "reason": "", "team": "undertow"}, {"id": 23981, "ts": 1795592264.966209, "season_id": 0, "arena": "polymarket", "side": "sell", "symbol": "Yes \u00b7 Will the price of Ethereum be between $1,500 and $1,600 on November 25?", "market_id": "1151912684335583353528200749737217